{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af83405d5703b2cfd0a446d48da6728eada8b73eab8f4a68244ada63e523dd37", "ja": "（バレンタインイベントは大盛況だな。\nお客さんもみんなも、とっても楽しそうだ！）", "zh": "（情人节活动大受欢迎啊。\n观众和大家看起来都特别开心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "57bf8e70c271a6568c41fdff9236ba64f955fecb6192e29059732cbf48821227", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}、こんなとこにいた。\n会場広いから、探しちゃったよ。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，原来你在这儿。\n会场这么大，我找了你好一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7bce2e4e76b263719942aaead387b56c4175ff693be5388a891f7475536c7443", "ja": "お疲れ様、恵美。\n探してたって、何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，惠美。听说你在找我，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "4d92611b38f70d0c176835a4585cd95062e31494b896c6af6bec59546261645f", "ja": "うちのチームのチョコ、渡そうと思って。\nあ、安心して！　これはちゃんとしたやつだから。", "zh": "想把我们队的巧克力送给你。\n啊，放心吧！这个是做得很漂亮的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "4d2bdc710c48a0301da58b60be2af4a5a1270adac26120abbf27be348f7d52bb", "ja": "せっかくだから、{$P$}にも\n綺麗なの食べてほしいなと思って。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我也想让{$P$}吃点漂亮的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9303ee3213d0da95c70b62352f0d599b6383bba84b5e49f8485584b09cb59825", "ja": "そうだったのか。ありがとう、恵美。", "zh": "原来是这样。谢谢你，惠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "4ece6d4902e3343805149cb5ea2a9c87c4321ffa7d7940bc3affa35ccda6d61f", "ja": "どういたしまして！　なんかみんなで料理するのって、\n学校の調理実習みたいで楽しーよね。", "zh": "不客气！大家一起做饭，感觉就像在学校上烹饪实践课一样，很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "b93e0b1cfc19aca15c3f9307e85eadc5bfcf5881a54d293219a67f06181c6230", "ja": "まあ、ジュリアが謎の食べ物を生み出そうとした時は、\n律子さんがすごい焦ってたけど……。", "zh": "不过，茱莉亚打算做出谜之食物的时候，\n律子小姐倒是慌得不行就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "fc269ce3238c5d575e9d4d46f94d5daebd6828d2d4a3ad45d767d999502ba6af", "ja": "あ、そのチョコレートだけど……\n1個だけ、他と違うフレーバーが入ってるから。", "zh": "啊，对了，关于那些巧克力……\n其中只有1块加了不同的口味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "65700bb1e63ce4d060f7295e8331ded1f2c1374a7c6c37a0a4aff74217845143", "ja": "えっ？　どれだろう……？", "zh": "诶？是哪一个呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "358729d982c802133e534d08cb335867eadf234abdb74cf89a3f619e8123673a", "ja": "見ただけじゃわかんないってば。\nフレーバーって言ったでしょ？", "zh": "光看外表是看不出来的啦。\n我说了是口味嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "698b7e16a635e26bd88f60acbc902450f0d62ebd1e3252516e42ca5c09565c68", "ja": "大丈夫！　{$P$}はアタシの\nプロデューサーだもん、ちゃんと見つけられるよ♪", "zh": "没事的！{$P$}可是我的\n制作人嘛，肯定能找出来的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0283_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "5fbce848b20da0f505bcb2cd00b8d9d51e430cf7acd53940ddd8019212349080", "ja": "そのチョコ、全部食べてよね？\nんで、あとで答え合わせと感想、聞かせてね！", "zh": "那盒巧克力，你要全部吃完哦？\n然后记得告诉我答案对不对，还有吃后的感想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
